   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 23,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "church -- Church (true), Summary: The true church, composed of the whole number of regenerate persons from Pentecost to the first resurrection 1 Corinthians 15:52 united together and to Christ by the baptism with the Holy Spirit 1 Corinthians 12:12,13 is the body of Christ of which He is the Head Ephesians 1:22,23. As such, it is a holy temple for the habitation of God through the Spirit Ephesians 2:21,22, is \"one flesh\" with Christ Ephesians 5:30,31 and espoused to Him as a chaste virgin to one husband 2 Corinthians 11:2-4.\n\nperfect -- (See Scofield \"Matthew 5:48\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 28,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "grace -- Grace (imparted). Hebrews 12:15,28; 13:9; Romans 6:1; 2 Peter 3:18."
     }
    ]
   }
